pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Biome\" title=\"Classic Biome\">Classic Biome</a> | Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$777</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.57.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 6th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"Defend your area with a thing of bricks, while supplies last!\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Trowel</b> is a special item bought in the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a> for $777. It is part of the random rotation in the store.\n</p><p>When used, it creates a wall of painted sand (4 in height and 3 in length). It also makes a sound similar to the sound of the original Trowel in roblox. The wall disappears after about 20-30 seconds.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A wall appears when used. Initially, it does not have an owner and is displayed as an interactive object.</li>\n<li>You can move it with your hands.</li>\n<li>The wall will instantly disappear if you throw out the trowel.</li>\n<li>The wall is not subjected to any processing.</li>\n<li>The wall has a random color when created.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163709\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 58/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019395/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.649      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   44.649      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2943-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163709 and revision id 17618. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Classic Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Classic Store","exists":true}],"images":["Trowel.png"]}
